  "body_markdown": "About us\n\nmeet Dr. ChrisMeet The TeamLivewell DifferenceOffice TourTechnologyJoin Our Team\n\nservices\n\ndCOEFull Mouth ReconstructionSedation Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nSmile MakeoverPorcelain VeneersNo Prep VeneersGum RecontouringTeeth WhiteningDental Bonding\n\nImplant Dentistry\n\nDental ImplantsSingle ImplantsImplant BridgesAll-on-X ImplantsLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nDental CrownsInlays & OnlaysDental BridgesTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone GraftingRidge AugmentationTooth ExtractionSinus LiftWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nOrthodontics\n\nInvisalignBraces\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPreventive DentistryPreventive CleaningGum TherapyRoot Canal Therapy\n\nTMJ TreatmentDental Emergencies\n\nnew patient\n\nfirst visit & new examInsurance & FinancingBlog\n\nOur work\n\nSmile GalleryTestimonials\n\nContact\n\ncall (703) 690-0102Request An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\n703-690-0102\n\nLivewell Difference\n\nmeet Dr. Chris\n\nMeet The Team\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nOffice Tour\n\nTechnology\n\nServices\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nDCOE\n\nTMJ Treatment\n\nDental Emergencies\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPreventive\n\nDental Bridges\n\nRoot Canal\n\nProfessional Dental Cleaning\n\nScaling & Root Planing\n\nAll General Dentistry services\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nNo Prep Veneers\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nGum Recontouring\n\nAll Cosmetic Dentistry Services\n\nSingle Implants\n\nImplant Bridges\n\nAll-on-X Implants\n\nLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nAll Implant Dentistry Services\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nSinus Lift\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nInvisalign\n\nBraces\n\nAll Orthodontics Services\n\nDental Crowns\n\nTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nDental Bonding\n\nInlays & Onlays\n\nAll Restorative Dentistry Services\n\nNew Patient\n\nfirst visit & new exam\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nBlog\n\nTestimonials\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nCALL US: (703) 690-0102\n\nBOOK AN APPOINTMENT\n\nCosmetic Smile Virtual Consult\n\n\n# Improve Your SmileA Simple First Step\n\n\nNo-prep veneers, smile enhancements, or simply learning what is possible.\n\nShare two photos and start a complimentary online consult with Dr. Chris.\n\nStart my consultation\n\nHow it works\n\nComplimentary\n\nLimited time only\n\n100% Online\n\nTwo phone photos to start\n\nPersonal Review\n\nDirectly with Dr. Chris\n\n\n## Thinking About Improving Your Smile, But Not Sure Where to Start?\n\n\nOur complimentary Cosmetic Smile Virtual Consult is an easy way to begin. Whether you are curious about no-prep veneers, improving one tooth, enhancing your smile for photos, or simply learning what may be possible, this is a simple first step with Dr. Chris.\n\nStart now. No Pressure. Just Possibilities\n\nPersonalized plan\n\nConservative Approach\n\nNatural Results\n\nDesigned Around You\n\n\n## This virtual consult is idealif you are interested in:\n\n\n\n#### No-prep veneers\n\n\nReshape and brighten your smile with little to no tooth shaving, whenever the case allows.\n\n\n#### Fixing One Tooth\n\n\nA chip, old bonding, or the one tooth you notice in every photo — often a small change with a big difference.\n\n\n#### A More Confident Smile in Photos\n\n\nCleaner, brighter, more even — so you stop holding back your smile on camera.\n\n\n#### Knowing Where to Start\n\n\nA simple way to learn whether your case is straightforward or more involved, before any decision is made.\n\n\n## How the virtual smile consultation works\n\n\n01\n\n\n### Add a Close-Up Smile Photo\n\n\nYou do not need professional photos. Phone photos in good natural light are perfect.\n\nA smiling selfie (full face)\n\nGood natural light, facing a window\n\nNo filters needed\n\nA close-up of your smile\n\n02\n\n\n### Share your smile goals\n\n\nTell us what you notice about your smile and what you’d love to change. Your goals will help Dr. Chris understand what matters most to you and personalize your consultation.\n\nWhiter, brighter teeth\n\nImproved tooth shape, size, or symmetry\n\nFixing chips, gaps, wear, or uneven edges\n\nA natural-looking smile you feel confident sharing\n\n03\n\n\n### Book your virtual consult\n\n\nOnce your form and photos are submitted, book a complimentary 20-minute Google Meet with Dr. Chris. Consults are scheduled on the hour and half-hour to give each patient enough time.\n\nThis is not a final diagnosis. It is a thoughtful first step.\n\n04\n\n\n### Meet with Dr. Chris\n\n\nDr. Chris reviews your photos, listens to what you are hoping for, and helps you understand possible next steps.\n\nNo-prep or porcelain veneers\n\nCosmetic bonding or whitening\n\nOrthodontics, if it fits your goals\n\nOr a more comprehensive evaluation\n\nStart Your Virtual Consultation\n\n\n## start with the 2 minute smile quiz.\n\n\nA few simple questions help us understand your goals, worries, and what matter most toyou\n\n\n## The best cosmetic dentistry starts before the teeth are touched.\n\n\nThis consult gives us a simple way to start with your story, your photos, and what you actually want your smile to feel like. From there, we can help you understand what may be possible.\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
